{
  "mode": "chapter",
  "errors": [],
  "readings": [
    {
      "hash": "#chapter-1",
      "images": 30,
      "broken": [],
      "overflow": false,
      "balloons": [
        {
          "panel": "N1-09",
          "text": "Intake is beyond the gate. Deliver before closing. Then we discuss upper routes.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N1-09",
          "text": "I practiced looking unimpressed. How am I doing?",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N1-11",
          "text": "The brake is gone!",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N1-11",
          "text": "SeraAren. That gate will not wait.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N1-12",
          "text": "Neither will he.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N1-12",
          "text": "You understand what you are giving up?",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N1-13",
          "text": "It pulls me. Not the whole car.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N1-13",
          "text": "Keep your harness on, Pell.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N1-14",
          "text": "PellAll right. I have you.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N1-14",
          "text": "ArenWait for my hand.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N1-16",
          "text": "Stay behind me!",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N1-17",
          "text": "Pell. Unclip. Now.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N1-18",
          "text": "Your arm\u2014",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N1-18",
          "text": "Complain after we land.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N1-20",
          "text": "Thank you.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N1-20",
          "text": "Give me a moment.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N1-21",
          "text": "No stamp. I cannot change that.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N1-21",
          "text": "I know. That does not make me less angry.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N1-22",
          "text": "This is addressed to you. From Lower District.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N1-22",
          "text": "That district has been empty for twenty years.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N1-24",
          "text": "A job offer. Show them this seal. I gave them your name.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N1-24",
          "text": "Who is them?",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N1-25",
          "text": "People who still need their post.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N1-25",
          "text": "You could have told the gate inspector.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N1-26",
          "text": "He did. Twice. I filed both reports.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N1-27",
          "text": "Your line held a second person. You qualify for a control branch.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N1-27",
          "text": "But not the gate.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N1-28",
          "text": "CHOOSE A BRANCH\nReach: longer anchor range\nHold: brake during a pull",
          "font": "14px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N1-28",
          "text": "SeraHold needs your full attention. You cannot strike while braking.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N1-29",
          "text": "Then teach me to stop.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N1-29",
          "text": "Hold I learned\nOne line \u00b7 fixed metal anchor\nRelease concentration: pull resumes",
          "font": "14px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N1-30",
          "text": "You can reach that post. Open the wicket from below.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N1-30",
          "text": "Look at where you will stop.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N1-31",
          "text": "Keep it dry. They have waited long enough.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N1-32",
          "text": "Inside the coat. Both hands free to work.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N1-34",
          "text": "Hold\u2014",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N1-35",
          "text": "I stopped.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N1-35",
          "text": "SeraYou did. Next time, before the railing.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N1-36",
          "text": "ArenStill dry.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N1-37",
          "text": "First working entrance in six months.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "snapshot_sha256": "e08e3a27b4f960243ecd9a571e680acd5c6091f09dd97e578cb0876c9d8fcb31"
}
